      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The hyena can emit a brief yip at one friendly hyena or gnoll it can see within 30 feet of it, warning the target of danger. The next attack roll against the target before the start of the hyena's turn has disadvantage."
      ]
    },
    {
